      "comment": "Allpa: Tepal",
      "content": "Tepal was Allpa's son, who longed to fly like his mother and failed the Qucusaur riders' trial, becoming Wingless. He researched Phlogiston-based jetpacks and died in an experiment. Allpa took his name, wore a mask as \"Tepal\" and kept his airborne workshop running. His wish, as she tells it, was a world where the skies are for all of humanity to share.",
